BTW EXTRA CREDIT: special characters in strings (symbols/keywords inside a YARN are just text)
HAI
  WAZZUP
    I HAS A note ITZ "VISIBLE is a keyword but here it is just text"
  BUHBYE

  VISIBLE note
  VISIBLE "WAZZUP BUHBYE HAI KTHXBYE"
  VISIBLE "SUM OF 1 AN 2 is not evaluated here"
  VISIBLE "symbols: @ # $ % ^ & * ( ) - + = [ ] { } | ; : ' < > ? /"
  VISIBLE "GTFO FOUND YR HOW IZ I"
  VISIBLE "O RLY? YA RLY NO WAI OIC"
KTHXBYE

BTW EXPECTED OUTPUT:
BTW VISIBLE is a keyword but here it is just text
BTW WAZZUP BUHBYE HAI KTHXBYE
BTW SUM OF 1 AN 2 is not evaluated here
BTW symbols: @ # $ % ^ & * ( ) - + = [ ] { } | ; : ' < > ? /
BTW GTFO FOUND YR HOW IZ I
BTW O RLY? YA RLY NO WAI OIC
